# libSecureComponent/ is a git submodule (see .gitmodules) pointing at the
# private 52-1ab/artifacts repo -- the real, proprietary NPCI/PhonePe (and
# BHIM/Navi/Central Bank/KreditBee) binaries this project reimplements.
# Tracked as a submodule reference, not ignored: `git submodule update --init`
# populates it for anyone with read access to that private repo; everyone
# else just sees an empty directory, which RealLibraryTest already handles
# (it aborts rather than fails when no *.so files are found there).
